  "caveats": [
    "Durable TypeScript tasks, not arbitrary interactive VMs; mode is alt. Billed allocated machine seconds when executing plus $0.000025/run.",
    "Wait >5 seconds and parent waiting for subtasks are checkpointed and unbilled. No execution timeouts. Free 20 concurrency; Hobby 50; Pro 200 + $10/month per 50.",
    "Extra Pro seats $20/month beyond 25; HIPAA BAA is add-on not an included plan fee.",
    "Null values mean unknown, not free/unlimited. No model-token cost, tax or unverified ancillary charge included.",
    "Native browser/device/task/credit prices with unknown CPU/RAM are deliberately non-priceable. Check regime before interpreting any partial resource estimate."
  ],
